  "description": "PUWWUA crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H114 N16 O66 Pr9 1+,N1 O3 1-,4(C2 H3 N1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 8 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr2B (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr2A (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr2C (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr3B (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr3A (Pr) has 9 O neighbors; Pr3C (Pr) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.747-5.328 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.25-163.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Pr9(H2L)8(OH)10(NO3)8](NO3)·(H2O)2(CH3CN). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 10 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
